<title>BELGIUM: Belgian state spending stable in year to September.</title>
<headline>Belgian state spending stable in year to September.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Primary spending by the Belgian federal state was 829.5 billion Belgian francs in the first nine months of 1996, compared to 830.0 billion francs in the year-earlier period, the budget ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>Corrected for inflation, spending fell 1.6 percent, the ministry said in a statement.</p>
